<<
/Title (AuraID: A Non-Blockchain Zero-Knowledge Proof System for Privacy-Preserving Student Identity Verification)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 469 0 R
/First 771 0 R
/Last 772 0 R
/Count -9
/Next 773 0 R
>>
endobj
705 0 obj
<<
/Title (AuraID successfully demonstrates the feasibility of a high- performance, privacy-preserving student identity framework that operates independently of distributed ledger technol- ogy[cite: 75, 77]. By integrating Zero-Knowledge Proof \(ZKP\) cryptography into a modern Spring Boot and Angular architec- ture, the system achieves a 100x reduction in issuance latency compared to blockchain-based alternatives while maintaining strict data sovereignty[cite: 73]. The inclusion of AI-driven modules for intelligent OCR and anomaly detection ensures that the system is not only cryptographically secure but also resilient against evolving fraudulent patterns and scalable for legacy institutional data. AuraID proves that the sub- 120ms verification threshold required for real-time institutional use can be met using standard web technologies and We- bAssembly, providing a robust foundation for a future where student identity is decentralized, private, and intelligently protected[cite: 76].)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 774 0 R
/First 775 0 R
/Last 775 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 470 0 R
>>
endobj
