/Title (Zero-Knowledge Proofs \(ZKPs\) form the foundation of many modern privacy-preserving systems. The basic idea is that a prover can convince a verifier that a statement is true without revealing any additional information. Earlier work in this area focused heavily on zk-SNARKs, which require a trusted setup phase and can introduce certain risks.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 829 0 R
/Next 881 0 R
>>
